<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Cenbank fixes crown at 19.03/mark (19.18).</title>
<headline>Czech Cenbank fixes crown at 19.03/mark (19.18).</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) fixed the crown at 19.030 to the mark and 32.334 to the dollar on Friday after fixing it at 19.180 to the mark and 32.691 to the dollar on Thursday.</p>
<p>The central bank abolished a mark/dollar basket the crown was pegged to on Tuesday and said its fixing would follow the market and was only a reference point for the wider public.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
